OL,3,AI sent 200 LinkedIn messages and got a
OL,4,Ajob: How to nail networking
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor some, networking comes naturally
OL,7,Fbut for others, the thought of
OL,8,Fapproaching someone they don't know and
OL,9,Ftrying to make a professional
OL,10,Fconnection can fill them with dread.
OL,12,FWhether you're looking for your first
OL,13,Fjob, trying to get ahead at work or
OL,14,Fhoping to change career, building a
OL,15,Fnetwork can help you find opportunities
OL,16,Fand make connections.
OL,18,FNetworking doesn't have to mean working
OL,19,Fa room at a formal event - it can
OL,20,Fhappen in person over a coffee at work,
OL,21,Fthrough a chance conversation or
OL,22,Fonline, through email and social media.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
